Subject: ⏰ Reminder: "{{ task.title }}" is {{ 'overdue' if overdue else 'due soon' }}
<h2 style="margin:0 0 8px">Hi {{ r.first_name }}, quick reminder</h2>
<p>Your task <b>{{ task.title }}</b> is {{ '<b style="color:#e11d48">overdue</b>'|safe if overdue else 'due' }} ({{ task.due_at }}).</p>
<p><a href="{{ site }}/admin/tasks" style="display:inline-block;background:#e11d48;color:#fff;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700">Mark it done</a></p>
